      "updated": 1734457217370,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- The OpenDataTelemetry is a real-time, high performance, high available \nand scalable stack for realiable device streaming to the network.\n\n- It is focused in simplicity and topic event based and the open-source \napproach allows to run on-premises, cloud, at the the edge even local.\n\n- As result, the OpenDataTelemetry provides real-time data streaming with kafka \nand/or mqtt brokers as well a timeseries-api to retrieve parsed and decoded data.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- The OpenDataTelemetry is a real-time, high performance, high available \nand scalable stack for realiable device streaming to the network.\n\n- It is focused in simplicity and topic event based and the open-source \napproach allows to run on-premises, cloud, at the the edge even local.\n\n- As result, the OpenDataTelemetry provides real-time data streaming with kafka \nand/or mqtt brokers as well a timeseries-api to retrieve parsed and decoded data.",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 262
    },
